    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Every interstate transport of goods above the exempted value must be accompanied by an e‑Way bill generated on the GST portal. The bill records the shipper’s GSTIN, consignee details, and the exact value of the cargo.</p>
